OL,3,GNEWSAAdditional powers approved to
OL,4,Acombat street racing
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been approved to help tackle
OL,7,Fstreet racing, car cruising and other
OL,8,Fanti-social vehicle-related activities.
OL,10,FThe Public Space Protection Order
OL,11,F(PSPO), for the area covered by Central
OL,12,FBedfordshire, was agreed by the
OL,13,Fcouncil's executive.
OL,15,FA public consultation identified
OL,16,Fconcerns in Dunstable, Houghton Regis,
OL,17,FLeighton Buzzard, Biggleswade,
OL,18,FFlitwick, Ampthill, Sandy and Shefford,
OL,19,Fas well as many villages, and the A5
OL,20,Fand A6.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
